From 0b6e43942bb3cb78c63c3a6a0336f29da8820237 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 07:33:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 06/16] lax/regular-functions: proofs build at v4.33.0
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

23 files: Language-typed set-builder targets (isRegular_of_eq / term-level
.mpr / rw [show … from if_pos]) where convert-using-1 and rw now refuse
them, deriving Fintype on five enums replaced by derive_fintype% (broken
for nullary-constructor inductives at this mathlib pin), simpa given the
defs it used to see through, TransGen.mono and Pairwise.forall at their
new signatures. No statement changed; concepts untouched.
